luation adequate? (SWE-agent → OpenHands)\n- Is the error analysis insightful? (conf-stratified errors, FN taxonomy)\n- Is the early termination simulation convincing?\n- Are there missing experiments or controls?\n\n### 3. Clarity of Negative Results\n- Is the paper honest and rigorous about what failed and why?\n- Is the \"selection bias\" diagnosis well-supported?\n- Does the discussion of \"what went wrong\" (Section 11) provide genuine insight?\n\n### 4. Strength of Positive Findings\n- Is the LF temporal dynamics analysis (Section 8) methodologically sound?\n- Are the 4 stagnation transition patterns well-supported (87% coverage)?\n- Is this finding genuinely independent of probe performance?\n\n### 5. Missing Experiments or Weaknesses\n- Compare against the review context's 14 imagined experiments — are all covered?\n- Are there important controls or experiments the paper should have included but didn't?\n- Are there any methodological red flags?\n\nProduce a structured review with:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted)\n- Questions for Authors\n- Minor Issues\n- Overall Score (1-6) with justification\n- Confidence (1-5: 1=low, 5=expert)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QprabZCkkXQP6cEHHGFc4H","session_id":"16ab1c0f-3ad5-4e32-8f39-ad0da20f8dab","uuid":"3fbb2ee0-3225-4798-bb09-49699c5a59ce","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:05:06.844Z"}
