{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014BAd8S1JxKFhtvhfgSbPGv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- probe-multiseed（等待人工审批）\\\\n- baseline-meanpool-lr（等待人工审批）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **probe_001** (success): —\\\\n- **emb_001** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\ngpu-5090-2x-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 344, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VgSbjk31e3e87RE4tJELyi","session_id":"16ab1c0f-3ad5-4e32-8f39-ad0da20f8dab","uuid":"7b9b2c7c-ac49-4b2f-a037-c94c74e9fca7","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:05:46.150Z"}
